        (15, 16, 2),
        (15, 17, 2),
        (15, 18, 2),
        (16, 18, 2),
        (17, 18, 2),
        // The tank annex's bench run, layer 3, with a machine-sized
        // gap at (11, 22) for whatever wants standing there. It is
        // deliberately NOT joined to the department's green chamber
        // feed one tile east: a debug bench wired into the live station
        // is a debug bench that breaks the station. One length laid on
        // the door tile at (14, 22) joins them the day somebody wants
